sequenceDiagram
  participant R1 as Request 1
  participant R2 as Request 2 to 12
  participant C as CacheService (per node)
  participant X as Redis or Caffeine
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  R1->>C: getOrLoad(tenant, "analytics:dashboard:30")
  C->>X: GET t:tenant:analytics:dashboard:30
  X-->>C: miss
  C->>C: inflight.putIfAbsent(key, future) wins
  R2->>C: getOrLoad(same key)
  C->>X: GET (miss)
  C->>C: putIfAbsent returns existing future, join() and wait
  C->>DB: loader runs once (about 9 queries)
  DB-->>C: result
  C->>X: SET key value EX ttl plus or minus 10 percent
  C-->>R1: value
  C-->>R2: same value (no second load)
  Note over C,X: Redis down: GET throws, breaker opens for 5 s, loader result returned, cx.cache.fallback increments
